  {
   "id": "title",
   "label": "Revision 1: Reading Flowcharts",
   "content": "<div class=\"lesson-title-slide\"><p class=\"lesson-title-kicker\">Computational Thinking</p><h2 class=\"lesson-h2\">Revision 1: Reading Flowcharts</h2><p>Year 7</p></div><ul class=\"lesson-facts\"><li><strong>Today:</strong> read a flowchart. Say what the sprite does.</li><li><strong>Next lesson:</strong> Revision 2.</li><li><strong>Then:</strong> the exam.</li></ul>"
  },
  {
   "id": "key-words",
   "label": "Key Words: The Symbols",
   "content": "<h2 class=\"lesson-h2\">Key Words: The Symbols</h2><p class=\"lesson-lead\">Every shape has one job.</p><table class=\"donow-table\"><thead><tr><th>Shape</th><th>Name</th><th>Job</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td style=\"text-align:center\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 100 44\" width=\"100\" height=\"44\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"terminal shape\"><rect x=\"4\" y=\"6\" width=\"92\" height=\"32\" rx=\"16\" fill=\"var(--surface-2)\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke=\"var(--muted)\"/></svg></td><td><strong>Start/End</strong></td><td>Where the flowchart starts and stops.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"text-align:center\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 100 44\" width=\"100\" height=\"44\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"process shape\"><rect x=\"4\" y=\"6\" width=\"92\" height=\"32\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"var(--surface-2)\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke=\"var(--brand)\"/></svg></td><td><strong>Process</strong></td><td>An instruction. Example: Move 10 steps.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"text-align:center\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 100 44\" width=\"100\" height=\"44\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"io shape\"><polygon points=\"16,6 96,6 84,38 4,38\" fill=\"var(--surface-2)\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke=\"var(--brand)\"/></svg></td><td><strong>Input or output</strong></td><td>A message. Example: Say \"Hello\".</td></tr><tr><td style=\"text-align:center\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 100 44\" width=\"100\" height=\"44\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"decision shape\"><polygon points=\"50,2 96,22 50,42 4,22\" fill=\"rgba(253,214,99,.12)\" stroke=\"var(--warn)\" stroke-width=\"2\"/></svg></td><td><strong>Decision</strong></td><td>A question. It has a True arrow and a False arrow.</td></tr><tr><td style=\"text-align:center\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 100 44\" width=\"100\" height=\"44\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"arrow shape\"><line x1=\"10\" y1=\"22\" x2=\"80\" y2=\"22\" stroke=\"var(--brand)\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><polygon points=\"80,14 94,22 80,30\" fill=\"var(--brand)\"/></svg></td><td><strong>Arrow</strong></td><td>Shows the order. Follow the arrows.</td></tr></tbody></table>"
  },
  {
   "id": "read",
   "label": "Read a Flowchart",
   "content": "<h2 class=\"lesson-h2\">Read a Flowchart</h2><p class=\"lesson-lead\">Start at Start. Follow the arrows. One box at a time.</p><div class=\"lesson-do-now-columns\"><div><div class=\"lesson-fc\" style=\"--fc-box:var(--surface-2);--fc-edge:var(--brand);--fc-term:var(--muted);--fc-ink:var(--ink);--fc-dec:rgba(253,214,99,.12);--fc-dec-edge:var(--warn);--fc-arrow:var(--brand);--fc-label:var(--warn);--fc-badge:var(--warn);--fc-badge-ink:#1f1400;display:flex;justify-content:center\"><svg style=\"max-width:100%;max-height:400px;height:auto\" class=\"fc-svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 184 380\" width=\"184\" height=\"380\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Start; Move 20 steps; Say &quot;Hi&quot;; Move 30 steps; Say &quot;Bye&quot;; End\"><style>.fc-b{fill:var(--fc-box,#262a5a);stroke:var(--fc-edge,#8ab4f8);stroke-width:2}.fc-t{fill:var(--fc-box,#262a5a);stroke:var(--fc-term,#9aa0c8);stroke-width:2}.fc-d{fill:var(--fc-dec,#3a2f10);stroke:var(--fc-dec-edge,#fdd663);stroke-width:2}.fc-line{stroke:var(--fc-edge,#8ab4f8);stroke-width:2;fill:none}.fc-e{stroke:var(--fc-arrow,#9aa6ff);stroke-width:2;fill:none}.fc-x{fill:var(--fc-ink,#eef0ff);font:600 14px/1 system-ui,Roboto,sans-serif;text-anchor:middle}.fc-sm{font-size:13px}.fc-l{fill:var(--fc-label,#fdd663);font:700 13px system-ui,Roboto,sans-serif}.fc-title{fill:var(--fc-label,#fdd663);font:700 13px system-ui,Roboto,sans-serif}.fc-n{fill:var(--fc-badge,#fdd663)}.fc-nt{fill:var(--fc-badge-ink,#1f1400);font:800 13px system-ui,sans-serif;text-anchor:middle}</style><defs><marker id=\"fc2a\" markerWidth=\"8\" markerHeight=\"8\" refX=\"6\" refY=\"3\" orient=\"auto\"><path d=\"M0,0 L6,3 L0,6 Z\" style=\"fill:var(--fc-arrow,#9aa6ff)\"/></marker></defs><path class=\"fc-e\" d=\"M92 48 L92 78\" marker-end=\"url(#fc2a)\"/><path class=\"fc-e\" d=\"M92 114 L92 142\" marker-end=\"url(#fc2a)\"/><path class=\"fc-e\" d=\"M92 178 L92 206\" marker-end=\"url(#fc2a)\"/><path class=\"fc-e\" d=\"M92 242 L92 270\" marker-end=\"url(#fc2a)\"/><path class=\"fc-e\" d=\"M92 306 L92 336\" marker-end=\"url(#fc2a)\"/><rect class=\"fc-t\" x=\"40\" y=\"16\" width=\"104\" height=\"32\" rx=\"16\"/><text class=\"fc-x\" x=\"92\" y=\"36.5\">Start</text><rect class=\"fc-b\" x=\"12\" y=\"78\" width=\"160\" height=\"36\" rx=\"3\"/><text class=\"fc-x\" x=\"92\" y=\"100.5\">Move 20 steps</text><polygon class=\"fc-b\" points=\"26,142 172,142 158,178 12,178\"/><text class=\"fc-x\" x=\"92\" y=\"164.5\">Say &quot;Hi&quot;</text><rect class=\"fc-b\" x=\"12\" y=\"206\" width=\"160\" height=\"36\" rx=\"3\"/><text class=\"fc-x\" x=\"92\" y=\"228.5\">Move 30 steps</text><polygon class=\"fc-b\" points=\"26,270 172,270 158,306 12,306\"/><text class=\"fc-x\" x=\"92\" y=\"292.5\">Say &quot;Bye&quot;</text><rect class=\"fc-t\" x=\"40\" y=\"336\" width=\"104\" height=\"32\" rx=\"16\"/><text class=\"fc-x\" x=\"92\" y=\"356.5\">End</text></svg></div></div><div><table class=\"donow-table\"><thead><tr><th>Box</th><th>What happens</th><th>Steps so far</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Start</td><td>Begin here.</td><td>0</td></tr><tr><td>Move 20 steps</td><td>The sprite moves.</td><td>20</td></tr><tr><td>Say \"Hi\"</td><td>The sprite says Hi.</td><td>20</td></tr><tr><td>Move 30 steps</td><td>The sprite moves.</td><td>50</td></tr><tr><td>Say \"Bye\"</td><td>The sprite says Bye.</td><td>50</td></tr><tr><td>End</td><td>Stop.</td><td><strong>50</strong></td></tr></tbody></table><p>The sprite moves <strong>50 steps</strong>. It says <strong>Hi</strong>, then <strong>Bye</strong>.</p></div></div>"
  },
