   "id": "loops",
   "label": "Key-Press Loops",
   "content": "<h2 class=\"lesson-h2\">Key-Press Loops</h2><p class=\"lesson-lead\">A key press is an <strong>input</strong>. The decision checks it.</p><div class=\"lesson-do-now-columns\"><div><div class=\"lesson-fc\" style=\"--fc-box:var(--surface-2);--fc-edge:var(--brand);--fc-term:var(--muted);--fc-ink:var(--ink);--fc-dec:rgba(253,214,99,.12);--fc-dec-edge:var(--warn);--fc-arrow:var(--brand);--fc-label:var(--warn);--fc-badge:var(--warn);--fc-badge-ink:#1f1400;display:flex;justify-content:center\"><svg style=\"max-width:100%;max-height:400px;height:auto\" class=\"fc-svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 282 270\" width=\"282\" height=\"270\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Start; Right arrow pressed? (True to Point in direction 90, False to Right arrow pressed?); Point in direction 90; Move 10 steps\"><style>.fc-b{fill:var(--fc-box,#262a5a);stroke:var(--fc-edge,#8ab4f8);stroke-width:2}.fc-t{fill:var(--fc-box,#262a5a);stroke:var(--fc-term,#9aa0c8);stroke-width:2}.fc-d{fill:var(--fc-dec,#3a2f10);stroke:var(--fc-dec-edge,#fdd663);stroke-width:2}.fc-line{stroke:var(--fc-edge,#8ab4f8);stroke-width:2;fill:none}.fc-e{stroke:var(--fc-arrow,#9aa6ff);stroke-width:2;fill:none}.fc-x{fill:var(--fc-ink,#eef0ff);font:600 14px/1 system-ui,Roboto,sans-serif;text-anchor:middle}.fc-sm{font-size:13px}.fc-l{fill:var(--fc-label,#fdd663);font:700 13px system-ui,Roboto,sans-serif}.fc-title{fill:var(--fc-label,#fdd663);font:700 13px system-ui,Roboto,sans-serif}.fc-n{fill:var(--fc-badge,#fdd663)}.fc-nt{fill:var(--fc-badge-ink,#1f1400);font:800 13px system-ui,sans-serif;text-anchor:middle}</style><defs><marker id=\"fc5a\" markerWidth=\"8\" markerHeight=\"8\" refX=\"6\" refY=\"3\" orient=\"auto\"><path d=\"M0,0 L6,3 L0,6 Z\" style=\"fill:var(--fc-arrow,#9aa6ff)\"/></marker></defs><path class=\"fc-e\" d=\"M130 48 L130 83\" marker-end=\"url(#fc5a)\"/><path class=\"fc-e\" d=\"M130 141 L130 158\" marker-end=\"url(#fc5a)\"/><text class=\"fc-l\" x=\"140\" y=\"155\" text-anchor=\"start\">True</text><path class=\"fc-e\" d=\"M130 194 L130 222\" marker-end=\"url(#fc5a)\"/><path class=\"fc-e\" d=\"M50 240 L30 240 L30 61 L130 61\" marker-end=\"url(#fc5a)\"/><path class=\"fc-e\" d=\"M218 112 L264 112 L264 71 L130 71\" marker-end=\"url(#fc5a)\"/><text class=\"fc-l\" x=\"224\" y=\"106\" text-anchor=\"start\">False</text><rect class=\"fc-t\" x=\"78\" y=\"16\" width=\"104\" height=\"32\" rx=\"16\"/><text class=\"fc-x\" x=\"130\" y=\"36.5\">Start</text><polygon class=\"fc-d\" points=\"130,83 218,112 130,141 42,112\"/><text class=\"fc-x fc-sm\" x=\"130\" y=\"109.5\">Right arrow</text><text class=\"fc-x fc-sm\" x=\"130\" y=\"123.5\">pressed?</text><rect class=\"fc-b\" x=\"50\" y=\"158\" width=\"160\" height=\"36\" rx=\"3\"/><text class=\"fc-x fc-sm\" x=\"130\" y=\"173.5\">Point in direction</text><text class=\"fc-x fc-sm\" x=\"130\" y=\"187.5\">90</text><rect class=\"fc-b\" x=\"50\" y=\"222\" width=\"160\" height=\"36\" rx=\"3\"/><text class=\"fc-x\" x=\"130\" y=\"244.5\">Move 10 steps</text></svg></div></div><div><ul class=\"lesson-facts\"><li><strong>Pressed:</strong> follow the <strong>True</strong> arrow. Point, then Move.</li><li><strong>Not pressed:</strong> follow the <strong>False</strong> arrow. No move.</li><li>Both arrows go back to the decision. It <strong>checks again</strong>.</li><li>Pressed, not pressed, pressed: 10 + 0 + 10 = <strong>20 steps</strong>.</li><li>Right 90. Left -90. Up 0. Down 180.</li></ul></div></div>"
  },
  {
