   "embedContainerId": "y7r1-plenary",
   "content": "<h2 class=\"lesson-h2\">Plenary: Revision 1 Drill</h2><p class=\"lesson-lead\">Symbols, reading, fixing and key-press loops. Your progress is saved.</p><div id=\"y7r1-plenary\"></div>"
